# This repository is LF-only. Without this, Windows Git rewrites checked-out files to CRLF
# and produces noisy diffs in test fixtures and the acceptance matrix.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.zip binary
# A unified diff preserves the pinned upstream CMake whitespace as literal context.
/scripts/wxhelper-receive-only.patch -whitespace
